{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108522","id":2659494607,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ehKrP","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108522","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108522.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108522.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108522","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108522/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108522/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108522/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/058d10f305f7d27889f2dcc0a2198ebc2593292c","number":108522,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix GI and SSR artifacts with camera frustum offset","user":{"login":"SwordofMorning","id":61505018,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNTA1MDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61505018?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning","html_url":"https://github.com/SwordofMorning","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Description\r\nThis PR fixes rendering artifacts in VoxelGI, SDFGI, and Screen Space Reflections when using Camera3D with frustum offset.\r\n\r\nFixes #108508 \r\n\r\n## Problem\r\nWhen `frustum_offset` is set to non-zero values in Camera3D, global illumination and screen-space effects render with incorrect positioning, causing visual artifacts where lighting and reflections appear displaced from their actual locations.\r\n\r\n## Root Cause\r\nThe rendering effects perform screen-space to world-space coordinate transformations using projection information, but were not accounting for the frustum offset in their calculations.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n- Added `offset` member to `Projection` struct to store frustum offset\r\n- Implemented `get_offset()` method to retrieve the stored offset\r\n- Updated projection info calculations in affected rendering effects to compensate for the offset\r\n- Temporarily disabled size assertion for Projection struct in extension API\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n- Verified fix using the reproduction project from issue #108508\r\n- Confirmed VoxelGI, SDFGI, and SSR effects now render correctly with frustum offset\r\n- No regressions observed in normal projection scenarios\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\nThe extension API size check is temporarily disabled as this is a targeted fix. A future PR could address this more comprehensively if needed.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-07-11T15:27:06Z","updated_at":"2025-07-12T10:31:45Z","closed_at":"2025-07-11T19:49:41Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"715c583090ae60618d19fbac36374bbfb9c5ad8f","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"SwordofMorning:master","ref":"master","repo":null,"sha":"058d10f305f7d27889f2dcc0a2198ebc2593292c","user":{"login":"SwordofMorning","id":61505018,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNTA1MDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61505018?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning","html_url":"https://github.com/SwordofMorning","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},"base":{"label":"godotengine:master","ref":"master","repo":{"id":15634981,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxNTYzNDk4MQ==","name":"godot","full_name":"godotengine/godot","owner":{"login":"godotengine","id":6318500,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjYzMTg1MDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6318500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/godotengine","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/godotengine